    conflict: "India's own Gaganyaan rocket was years from carrying people. ISRO needed a trained astronaut and real station experience now, so it bought a seat on a private American mission.",
    surprise: "The launch had been delayed for weeks by a fuel leak and by a leak on the station itself. When Grace finally docked on 26 June, Shukla became the first Indian ever aboard the International Space Station.",
